      "schema:description": "This distribution of the dataset is in the form of a data collection with one entry per molecule which contains curated metadata, optimised geometries (at B3LYP/6-31g* level of theory), complete electronic-structure output files, and computed excited-state energies and oscillator strengths for low-lying singlet and triplet states.",
